      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews highlight the gentle care given to fearful puppies, anxious adult dogs, and semi-feral cats during visits. Clients note that staff handle heavy pet carriers with care and keep stressed animals calm during examinations. Owners express peace of mind knowing their companions are treated with patience and care."
      }
    },
